---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CertificationBadges from '../../components/ui/CertificationBadges.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] mb-4">Commercial Energy Storage</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-[#4b5563] mb-8">
        Cut demand charges. Shift peak loads. Protect critical operations. Improve sustainability metrics.
      </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[#2563eb] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-[#1d4ed8] transition-all shadow-md" style="color: white !important;">
        Request Commercial Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-[#f5f2eb] rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-5xl mb-4">🏭</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] mb-4">Electricity is your second biggest expense after payroll</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4b5563] text-lg">Commercial and industrial customers face demand charges, time-of-use rates, and power quality issues. Vestwoods battery storage solves all three.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] text-center mb-12">How Commercial Storage Works</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-[#2563eb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-4">📊</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1f2937] mb-2">1. Analyze Load Profile</h3>
          <p class="text-[#4b5563]">We identify your peak demand periods and time-of-use rate windows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-[#2563eb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-4">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1f2937] mb-2">2. Discharge During Peaks</h3>
          <p class="text-[#4b5563]">Battery powers your facility during high-rate periods, reducing demand charges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-[#2563eb]/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-4">💰</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#1f2937] mb-2">3. Save 20-40% on Bills</h3>
          <p class="text-[#4b5563]">Typical commercial customers see [XX]% reduction in monthly electricity costs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-[#f5f2eb] rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] text-center mb-12">Key Business Benefits</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">Reduce demand charges</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Shave peak demand by [XX] kW → save $[XXX]/month</span></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">Time-of-use arbitrage</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Charge at night (low rates), discharge during day (high rates)</span></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">Uninterruptible power</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Protect servers, freezers, and critical equipment</span></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">Demand response revenue</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Earn payments for reducing load during grid events</span></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">EV charging integration</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Support fleet charging without grid upgrades</span></div></div>
        <div class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-green-600 text-xl">✓</span><div><strong class="text-[#1f2937]">Sustainability reporting</strong><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Reduce Scope 2 emissions with time-matched renewables</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] text-center mb-8">Recommended Configuration</h2>
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm">
        <table class="w-full">
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">Battery Capacity</td><td class="py-3 text-[#4b5563]">50kWh – 500kWh+ (modular, scales with your needs)</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b"><td class="py-3 font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">Inverter Power</td><td class="py-3 text-[#4b5563]">10kW – 250kW (3-phase)</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="py-3 font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">Typical Payback</td><td class="py-3 text-[#4b5563]">3-5 years (depending on utility rates and incentives)</td></tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-[#f5f2eb] rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] mb-4">ROI Calculator (Placeholder)</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-[#4b5563] mb-4">A typical 100kWh system for a mid-size commercial facility:</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">$[XX,XXX]</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Annual savings</span></div>
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">[X.X] years</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Payback period</span></div>
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">[XX] tons</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">CO₂ reduction/year</span></div>
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">10+ years</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">System life</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">*REPLACE: Add actual calculator or accurate numbers for your market</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1f2937] mb-6">Certified for Commercial Use</h2>
      <CertificationBadges />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-[#f5f2eb] rounded-2xl my-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] text-center mb-8">Case Study Placeholder</h2>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="font-semibold text-[#1f2937] mb-2">[Customer: Manufacturing Plant / Retail Chain / Office Building]</div>
        <p class="text-[#4b5563] mb-4">[Location]</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-center mb-4">
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">[XX]%</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Demand reduction</span></div>
          <div><span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">$[XX,XXX]/year</span><br /><span class="text-[#4b5563]">Saved on electricity</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#4b5563] italic">"[REPLACE: Add actual testimonial from commercial customer about system performance and ROI]"</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1f2937] text-center mb-8">FAQ for Businesses</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">What's the installation timeline?</h3><p class="text-[#4b5563]">8-12 weeks from contract to commissioning for typical commercial systems.</p></div>
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">Do you offer financing?</h3><p class="text-[#4b5563]">[REPLACE: Add financing options – PPA, lease, loan, or outright purchase]</p></div>
        <div class="border-b pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">What happens during a grid outage?</h3><p class="text-[#4b5563]">System automatically islands, keeping your facility powered. Critical loads only, or full backup depending on configuration.</p></div>
        <div class="pb-4"><h3 class="font-semibold text-[#1f2937]">Can I stack incentives?</h3><p class="text-[#4b5563]">[REPLACE: List available federal, state, and utility incentives for commercial storage]</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#2563eb] rounded-2xl my-8 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: white !important;">Ready to cut your commercial electricity costs?</h2>
      <p class="mb-8" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) !important;">Talk to our commercial team about a site assessment and custom proposal.</p>
      <a href="/contact?product=commercial" class="bg-white text-[#2563eb] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold inline-block hover:bg-gray-100 transition-all">Schedule Consultation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>